  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Access control",
      "items": [
        "Owner: manages the whitelist; renounceOwnership() always reverts and the fee recipient cannot be removed",
        "Admin: setStrategy, setEmergencyMode, reinvest, setProtocolFee (max 25%), setFeeRecipient; on the strategy, setLeverage and setHealthFactors",
        "Strategies accept deposit, withdraw, reinvest and setEmergencyMode only from their VAULT (onlyVault)",
        "The whitelist applies to the receiver of deposit and mint and to the recipient of every share transfer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Emergency",
      "items": [
        "Anyone can call checkHealth(); below minHealthFactor the strategy calls vault.activateEmergencyMode()",
        "The vault forwards the flag with strategy.setEmergencyMode(true), which closes the position through exitPosition() inside try/catch",
        "While emergency mode is active, deposits and mints revert; withdrawals keep working"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Composition",
      "items": [
        "The vault has a single active strategy (setStrategy); both implementations are shown here",
        "AaveAdapter is a library of internal functions, compiled into each strategy",
        "UniswapV4Adapter is a base contract of WETHLoopStrategy and receives unlockCallback from the PoolManager"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Accounting",
      "items": [
        "Performance fee above the high-water mark, paid by minting shares to the fee recipient",
        "1,000 wei of dead shares in the vault constructor; strategies use a decimals offset of 6",
        "Loop totalAssets() = collateral + idle WETH − debt − outstanding flash loan"
      ]
    }
  ]
